"title": "Yesu na Shetani",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "yesu na shetani",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Shetani ni wakala binafsi wa dhambi na uovu ambaye alimpinga Yesu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004001\" data-end-ref=\"40004011\">Mathayo 4:1–11</data>).</p><p>Injili ya Mathayo inamrejelea kiumbe huyu kama:</p><ul><li><p>“Shetani,” ambayo inamaanisha <em>mpinzani</em> au <em>mshindani</em> (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004010\" data-end-ref=\"40004010\">4:10</data>)</p></li><li><p>“Shetani” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004001\" data-end-ref=\"40004011\">4:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013039\" data-end-ref=\"40013039\">13:39</data>)</p></li><li><p>&quot;Mjaribu&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004003\" data-end-ref=\"40004003\">4:3</data>)</p></li><li><p>&quot;mfalme wa mapepo&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009034\" data-end-ref=\"40009034\">9:34</data>)</p></li><li><p>“Beelzebuli” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012024\" data-end-ref=\"40012024\">12:24</data>)</p></li><li><p>“mwenye uovu” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006013\" data-end-ref=\"40006013\">6:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013019\" data-end-ref=\"40013019\">13:19</data>)</p></li><li><p>“Adui” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013039\" data-end-ref=\"40013039\">13:39</data>)</p></li></ul><p>Ujumbe wa Yesu wa kutangaza na kuleta ufalme wa Mungu duniani ulisababisha migogoro na majeshi ya Shetani. Hii ilihusisha kuondoa pepo waliokuwa wakiwamiliki watu (kufukuza pepo) (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40008016\" data-end-ref=\"40008017\">Mathayo 8:16–17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40009032\" data-end-ref=\"40009034\">9:32–34</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40010001\" data-end-ref=\"40010001\">10:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40010007\" data-end-ref=\"40010008\">7–8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012022\" data-end-ref=\"40012029\">12:22–29</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41005001\" data-end-ref=\"41005020\">Marko 5:1–20</data>). Mathayo anabainisha kwamba Shetani ana nguvu juu ya falme (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004008\" data-end-ref=\"40004009\">Mathayo 4:8–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012026\" data-end-ref=\"40012026\">12:26</data>). Pia anaamuru malaika (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025041\" data-end-ref=\"40025041\">25:41</data>).</p><p>Njia kuu ya Shetani ya kusababisha madhara ni kupitia majaribu. Kusudi lake ni kuwafanya watu wasimtii Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004001\" data-end-ref=\"40004011\">Mathayo 4:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006013\" data-end-ref=\"40006013\">6:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40016023\" data-end-ref=\"40016023\">16:23</data>). Kama wakala wa Mungu kwa ajili ya wokovu wa binadamu, Yesu alikumbana na mashambulizi makali kutoka kwa Shetani (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004001\" data-end-ref=\"40004011\">Mathayo 4:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43013027\" data-end-ref=\"43013027\">Yohana 13:27</data>). Hata hivyo, Yesu alimshinda Shetani na hatimaye ataondoa nguvu zake zote (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025041\" data-end-ref=\"40025041\">Mathayo 25:41</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012031\" data-end-ref=\"43012031\">Yohana 12:31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66020001\" data-end-ref=\"66020010\">Ufunuo 20:1–10</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18001006\" data-end-ref=\"18001012\">Ayubu 1:6–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18002001\" data-end-ref=\"18002007\">2:1–7</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38003001\" data-end-ref=\"38003002\">Zekaria 3:1–2</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004001\" data-end-ref=\"40004011\">Mathayo 4:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013019\" data-end-ref=\"40013019\">13:19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40016023\" data-end-ref=\"40016023\">16:23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42010017\" data-end-ref=\"42010020\">Luka 10:17–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42013016\" data-end-ref=\"42013016\">13:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42022003\" data-end-ref=\"42022003\">22:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42022031\" data-end-ref=\"42022032\">31–32</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012031\" data-end-ref=\"43012031\">Yohana 12:31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43013027\" data-end-ref=\"43013027\">13:27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44005003\" data-end-ref=\"44005003\">Matendo 5:3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44026017\" data-end-ref=\"44026018\">26:17–18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47004004\" data-end-ref=\"47004004\">2 Wakorintho 4:4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47011013\" data-end-ref=\"47011014\">11:13–14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"54002014\" data-end-ref=\"54002014\">1 Timotheo 2:14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"54005015\" data-end-ref=\"54005015\">5:15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66012009\" data-end-ref=\"66012009\">Ufunuo 12:9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66020001\" data-end-ref=\"66020010\">20:1–10</data></p>",
